{"id":"n89534-9-21","stage":0,"title":"놓다 · 放","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89534-9-21-1","ko":"이 상자들은 어디에 둘까요?","zh":"这些箱子要放在哪儿呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상자들은","meaning":"箱子","explanation":"상자：箱子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"상자","audio":"/audio/e6bb1dea433d8fa4cdb5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62801","senseId":"1","lemma":"상자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"둘까요?","meaning":"搁，放置，摆放","explanation":"두다：搁，放置，摆放；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"e6bb1dea433d8fa4","term":"상자","zh":"箱子","audio":"/audio/e6bb1dea433d8fa4cdb5.mp3","entryId":"62801","definition":"存放东西的木制或纸制四方形筒。","pronunciation":["상자"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"搁，放置，摆放","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"放在某处。","pronunciation":["두다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9dac467af1c333b38120.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89534-9-21-2","ko":"거기 문 앞에 놓고 가세요.","zh":"把它们放在那边的门口吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语